# Security Recommendations

## Implement Property Allowlisting

Only explicitly permitted properties should be accepted from user input.

Example:

```
Allowed Fields

✓ email
✓ phone
✓ address

Blocked

✗ roleid
✗ isAdmin
✗ permissions
✗ accountType
```

---

## Use Data Transfer Objects (DTOs)

Never bind incoming JSON directly to domain models.

Instead:

```
JSON
   │
   ▼
DTO

email

   │
   ▼
Validation

   │
   ▼
Business Logic

   │
   ▼
User Entity
```

---

## Server-Side Authorization

Authorization-related properties should never be accepted from client input.

Role assignments must only be performed by trusted administrative functionality.

---

## Validate Unexpected Parameters

Reject any request containing unknown or unauthorized JSON properties.

